.input|xwiki/2.1
.# Consecutive standalone code macros. The code macros having only a language are rendered as fenced code blocks (the
.# info string being the language, or empty for "none"), the other ones (e.g. without language) using the macro syntax
.# since a fenced code block without info string is read back as a code macro with language="none". See code13.test
.# for the parsing of the generated Markdown.
.#-----------------------------------------------------
